# The templates in this repo are the output of a generator, so their line
# endings are part of the product. Without this, git on Windows checks them out
# as CRLF and the CLI emits CRLF there and LF everywhere else — two developers
# on one project would then get diffs that are nothing but line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
